  "description": "planMove over whole negotiations (SPEC.md §3, §5). Each case starts right after the peer joined: state awaiting, round 0, turn a, unless it says \"start\": \"draft\": then a has opened the room and b has not joined yet (state draft, round 0, turn a), and a step {\"join\": \"b\"} is b joining, which leaves the room as afterJoin says. A step either applies, leaving the room as `room` says, or is refused and changes nothing. `approve: \"on_table\"` stands for the subject_hash of the terms last tabled; any other string is sent as is.",
